@startuml
[*] --> Not_Started
Not_Started --> Accessing_Tracker : User accesses the tracker
Accessing_Tracker --> Viewing_Performance_Data : User views performance data
Viewing_Performance_Data --> Identifying_Issues : User identifies issues
Identifying_Issues --> Taking_Corrective_Actions : User takes corrective actions
Taking_Corrective_Actions --> Viewing_Performance_Data : User reviews performance
Taking_Corrective_Actions --> Exited : User exits the system
Viewing_Performance_Data --> Exited : User exits the system
[*] <--> Exited
@enduml
